%% VERITRAIL Agent MVP — architecture
flowchart TB
  classDef svc fill:#0B2545,stroke:#0B2545,color:#fff
  classDef tool fill:#E8F1F8,stroke:#0B2545,color:#0B2545
  classDef appr fill:#FDECEC,stroke:#C53030,color:#742A2A
  classDef store fill:#FFF7E6,stroke:#B7791F,color:#5F370E
  classDef guard fill:#13636B,stroke:#13636B,color:#fff

  U[User · role: viewer / assessor / approver / admin] --> CON[VERITRAIL Agent Console / API]
  CON --> IN[Input guard<br/>redaction · injection & jailbreak detection]:::guard
  IN --> ORC[Agent Orchestrator]:::svc
  ORC --> IR[Intent router<br/>ask · assess · gaps · report · guardrails · approval]:::svc
  ORC --> ST[Conversation state<br/>guided-assessment state machine]:::svc
  IR --> J1[Ask VERITRAIL]:::svc
  IR --> J2[Guided use-case assessment]:::svc
  IR --> J3[Gap analysis]:::svc
  IR --> J4[Report generation]:::svc
  IR --> J5[Guardrail design]:::svc

  subgraph TOOLS[14 least-privilege tools · grouped by permission]
    TR[READ<br/>search_veritrail_knowledge<br/>search_ai_inventory<br/>search_runtime_logs]:::tool
    TC[COMPUTE<br/>calculate_risk_tier<br/>identify_gaps<br/>recommend_controls]:::tool
    TD[CREATE / DRAFT<br/>create_ai_system_record<br/>start_assessment · submit_assessment_response<br/>generate_report · draft_runtime_policy]:::tool
    TW[WRITE + USER CONFIRMATION<br/>create_remediation_task]:::tool
    TA[APPROVAL REQUIRED<br/>request_human_approval<br/>export_evidence_pack]:::appr
  end
  J1 & J2 & J3 & J4 & J5 --> TOOLS

  TOOLS --> KB[(VERITRAIL knowledge base<br/>controls · templates · policy & industry packs · compliance mapping)]:::store
  TOOLS --> REC[(Enterprise records<br/>inventory · assessments · gaps · tasks)]:::store
  TA --> AQ[(Approval queue<br/>risk-tier change · exception · prod policy · evidence export · external comms)]:::appr
  AQ --> HUM[Human approver<br/>separation of duties]:::appr

  ORC --> OUT[Output guard<br/>citation validation · prohibited-claim check · evidence labels]:::guard
  OUT --> CON
  ORC -.optional phrasing only.-> LLM[LLM adapter<br/>redacted input]
  ORC & TOOLS --> AUD[(Hash-chained audit log · trace IDs)]:::store
